            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Misamu njozi kuti teensi misamu iiligwa, eyo ilike ilakonzya kutemwa akunyonyoonwa, kuti muyake zyakusinkinizya munzi ngomuli mukulwisya mane lumwi ukazundwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.20",
